### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 04: AOP & Audit Logging HTTP Requests
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Create Product (Triggers AOP @AuditLog: PRODUCT_CREATED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-AUD-1001",
  "name": "Audit Tracked Ultra Keyboard",
  "description": "Mechanically intercepted and logged by Spring AOP",
  "price": 199.99,
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Update Product (Triggers AOP @AuditLog: PRODUCT_UPDATED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-AUD-1001",
  "name": "Updated Audit Ultra Keyboard",
  "description": "Updated switches with RGB backlight",
  "price": 219.99,
  "stockQuantity": 18,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 3. Patch Product (Triggers AOP @AuditLog: PRODUCT_PATCHED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 189.99
}

### 4. Delete Product (Triggers AOP @AuditLog: PRODUCT_DELETED)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 5. Get Products (Triggers AOP @TrackExecutionTime performance profiling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=10

### 6. Admin: Query Audit Logs (PagedResponse of captured audit events)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?page=0&size=10
